EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}It's time to shop for summer
sweatpants, and {{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Isabelle{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} is giving us
all some Bells!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0010:}}{{TAG:0007:000B:}}We're getting a million Bells each!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}I'm gonna go get mine right now!{{TAG:0008:0000:0B0000000C000000}}
Yahoooo!
You lie!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}È ora di comprare dei vestiti
per l'estate! E {{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Fuffi{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} ha deciso
di regalare a tutti delle stelline...{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0010:}}{{TAG:0007:000B:}}... Un milione ciascuno!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Vado subito a prendere le mie!{{TAG:0008:0000:0B0000000C000000}}
Evviva evviva!
Stai mentendo!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Melinda{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} schenkt uns allen Sternis
für neue Sommerklamotten!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0010:}}{{TAG:0007:000B:}}Jeder kriegt 1.000.000 Sternis!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ich zieh mir nur schnell Laufschuhe
an und sprinte rüber zu ihr!{{TAG:0008:0000:0B0000000C000000}}
Juchhuuuu!
So ein Quatsch!

EN:
The {{TAG:0005:0005:}} town tune has hit
the million-seller mark!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}And the person who wrote the song{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
apparently gets a royalty of 10,000
Bells a month!{{TAG:0008:0000:0B0000000C000000}}
That's amazing!
Liar liar, pants on fire!

ES:
¡La melodía de {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0005:}} ha
alcanzado el millón de ventas!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Y la persona que la compuso{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
al parecer tiene derecho a cobrar
10 000 bayas al mes de royalties!{{TAG:0008:0000:0B0000000C000000}}
¡Es asombroso!
¡Menuda trola!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0005:0005:}} kasaba melodisi bir milyon
satışa ulaşmış!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Hem şarkıyı yazan kişi{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
ayda 10.000 Bell telif alıyormuş!{{TAG:0008:0000:0B0000000C000000}}
Müthiş!
Yalancının mumu yatsıya kadar yanar!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Ich hab gehört, dass ein mysteriöses
Schiff am Strand vor Anker liegt...{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0014:}}Ein großes, schwarzes Schiff...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Und sein Kapitän ist ein Geist!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}{{TAG:0008:0000:0B0000000C000000}}
Ich will's auch sehen!
Das ist 'ne Lüge!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Heh heh!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} I love the excitement of{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
seeing if I can get away with it!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}When it comes to practical jokes,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
I may be an addict!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Ja, ja!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡Es que no veas el subidón{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
de ver si cuela o no!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}¡Tengo que confesar que
soy adicto a las bromitas!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Eh eh eh!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Non posso fare a meno{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
del brivido dell'incertezza... ci
cascherà o non ci cascherà?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Vado matto per gli scherzi!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Forse mi piacciono un po' troppo!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Şakadan anlayabildiğine sevindim!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}
Ama güven diye bir şey olduğunu
da unutma, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!
